lose family relationship. This is the story of the trip.\n\nATLAS imagery: black hole, apocalypse, computer code, bugs, night, black space station, red gems, crow feathers, black chess, night walk.\nCyanine imagery: books, electronic music, blue gems, white chess, galaxies, dawn, stars, travel, greenhouse gardens, glass rooms, astronomical observations. The light that destroys the stars.\n\nI would be very happy if you could draw it. I will leave the composition, pose, etc. to you. I am open to costume changes.\nI apologize if I am rude in any way. Thank you very much.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LBbvkOWL0U_7kPWipFCKGzo_r9Gfg87v?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a3sn40yrgeqjt0k_4JPWJUkekQDYYWi5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c5460a3/uploads/origins/d926a191-c4df-4c0b-ba8a-19ee0968feb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5137ee7d6d40397a6216e91f3a2bb575", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c5460a3/uploads/origins/d926a191-c4df-4c0b-ba8a-19ee0968feb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5137ee7d6d40397a6216e91f3a2bb575, https://si.imgix.net/9c5460a3/uploads/origins/d926a191-c4df-4c0b-ba8a-19ee0968feb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed62879d7c49f22aa269cc116c95741d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c5460a3/uploads/origins/d926a191-c4df-4c0b-ba8a-19ee0968feb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6492a13f0e18f55d4a4160f49839369a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Mr. Crow, I'd like to invite you to draw these two characters for ......! I'd like to draw a horizontal composition that can be used as a banner (but it's up to you!)! Thank you for your hard work whether you accept the commission or not...\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1M2qAvVMDMmW6BiuFqR9zHVJaNI