 to laugh hysterically.\nPink hair and gray eyes.\n(Please refer to the attached document URL for details.)\nPose and composition are up to you!\n\nWe will use your drawing as a Twitter icon, header, etc. within the range of personal use 🙌.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-J4vj9zouT69lWpntWMaHboIrAXx9RDl", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/069268a8/uploads/origins/12b50662-2431-4729-b5d7-eb359858c32b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f74b85f55a01bc04ba18570ebdb1a33c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/069268a8/uploads/origins/12b50662-2431-4729-b5d7-eb359858c32b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f74b85f55a01bc04ba18570ebdb1a33c, https://si.imgix.net/069268a8/uploads/origins/12b50662-2431-4729-b5d7-eb359858c32b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=432a7875edcddaec7b1712be8b5c6daf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/069268a8/uploads/origins/12b50662-2431-4729-b5d7-eb359858c32b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2f0dc794178a9f5589b251b2af422d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your artworks. I would appreciate it if you can draw my original characters. The two boys are high school students and also band members. It doesn’t matter if you draw the instrument or not. There’re multiple outfits in the reference link that you can choose from and If there’s anything unclear about the outfits, please feel free to draw however you like or you can even design any outfits if you would prefer. \n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1--FzN77rE-GCT5MLzozH99g8kPAXmBRj", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20a1dbb5/uploads/origins/377432bb-d50a-476a-b553-05a49561deaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=cro