false, "body": "Hello. I really love your artwork and I'd be very happy if you can draw my original characters.\n\nThe black hair is a 18 years old exorcist. He's the serious type and doesn't smile much. The white hair is a ghost who always follows him and helps him in missions (you can draw him looking like normal people, no need to draw him floating or transparent). Although he looks friendly, he's a mysterious one. The white hair likes to tease the black hair and they usually fight over trivial things in daily life, but in missions they get along quite well.\n\nI'd love if you can draw them standing in an old style elevator or phone booth. The rest is up to you!\n\nThank you so much for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-QVHkf6w0yeNFEev-OY6QUbbyHnPLaCV?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/31174453/uploads/origins/e85ae08e-5a69-4df1-a966-c81d13aec6f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8b82e9fa4380c24c686560880a374ad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31174453/uploads/origins/e85ae08e-5a69-4df1-a966-c81d13aec6f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8b82e9fa4380c24c686560880a374ad, https://si.imgix.net/31174453/uploads/origins/e85ae08e-5a69-4df1-a966-c81d13aec6f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68c55c3009c668533712b6f8db428f48 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31174453/uploads/origins/e85ae08e-5a69-4df1-a966-c81d13aec6f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab76fea7ec6465398f25af7c58b029f0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you! Really love LOADINGさん's art style! May I request an illustration for my original characters? They are a couple, the blue-haired character is half-head taller than the red-haired character. The detailed description is in the link! Please feel free to change their clothes, hairstyles, and poses into your style.\n\nI hope my request could be accepted but if you feel the theme of this request is unsuitable, it's fine to just cancel it!\nThank you very much.\n\nred-haired character: https://sta.sh/2fte5x2czgu\nblue-haired character: https://sta.sh/211rl5p8izhl", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/610f7864/uploads/origins/5276366f-e079-4fa3-beba-618d00ddda66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19371d329c6515233877ddfc4ff8f1ca", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/610f7864/uploads/origins/5276366f-e079-4fa3-beba-618d00ddda66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19371d329c6515233877ddfc4ff8f1ca, https://si.imgix.net/610f7864/uploads/origins/5276366f-e079-4fa3-beba-618d00ddda66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ce9eaf1fedf6479c2a3a960aad1aaf9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/610f7864/uploads/origins/5276366f-e079-4fa3-beba-618d00ddda66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad98644d171dc704ca438653ef9ef0b9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thanks for opening Skeb! I love your wares. If you don't mind, I'd like to ask you to paint my OC. You can paint it any way you like, mood or otherwise! Thank you very much!\n\nThank you for opening Skeb! Could you please draw my character? She is a cool person with small face expressions. Draw freely as you want! I will be really glad to request you.\n\nThank you! https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FvnQ84EbVYcaurrN9-GOvRmTFIpagn1w?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1448ede/uploads/origins/6044cfe6-0746-46c1-86a3-9aa4365bcfc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9575a3a4d2c5a14b2737b2d1e29e466d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f1448ede/uploads/origins/6044cfe6-0746-46c1-86a3-9aa4365bcfc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9575a3a4d2c5a14b2737b2d1e29e466d, https://si.imgix.net/f1448ede/uploads/origins/6044cfe6-0746-46c1-86a3-9aa4365bcfc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec1c9f90d9ce63e873efb346ea80815c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f1448ede/uploads/origins/6044cfe6-0746-46c1-86a3-9aa4365bcfc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=671cf42bf19aa8b539518b7d53a5ed1a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "打扰老师了可以画画我的oc吗！\n职业是心理医生，如果您觉得金额太少或者不适合可以直接取消\n请随意的画，成年or幼年都可以！\n\nhttps://aaa4125723.lofter.com/post/4bf97647_2b4b39aa1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c9366e58/uploads/origins/7581f5bf-207b-41d5-910e-f4566475dcab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0d996fbf109c74d5401a7e2202338cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c9366e58/uploads/origins/7581f5bf-207b-41d5-910e-f4566475dcab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0d996fbf109c74d5401a7e2202338cb, https://si.imgix.net/c9366e58/uploads/origins/7581f5bf-207b-41d5-910e-f4566475dcab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=244776bfb10d733c8f54c07134a952f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c9366e58/uploads/origins/7581f5bf-207b-41d5-910e-f4566475dcab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57db60eb0bd8514f616d458d6dd5dac2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "打扰了！可以请老师画我的oc吗！\n衣服哪一套都可以！\n（如果金额不足或者不能画/设定不擅长的情况请直接取消request……！感谢！）\n\n蓝发的角色是在读军校的大学生，以前参加过唱诗班，喜欢古典音乐和发光的东西。\n阴沉、内向平稳的性格，极端利他主义者。另外会为了他人生存而伤害自己。 有点偏执+本质有点疯狂的个性。\n有进入他人梦中，修正别人的梦的能力。常常是用静脉注射的方式来帮助别人做梦。\n舞台是200年后的科幻。蓝色左眼是白色瞳孔，绿色右眼是黑色瞳孔。\n请随意！\n\n*使用/credit\n>SNS的头像/横幅、展示在个人网站上\n>私人使用或作为直播的壁纸（非商业）。\n>给朋友印点周边\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uUD4tmIAvG_tq3OvBESWxmw1TKbBVgo7?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a645ae8b/uploads/origins/b92e634f-97b3-4ed1-bc72-b8e33d45b8f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf9924611c6f252c56b4ed835ed03c8f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a645ae8b/uploads/origins/b92e634f-97b3-4ed1-bc72-b8e33d45b8f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf9924611c6f252c56b4ed835ed03c8f, https://si.imgix.net/a645ae8b/uploads/origins/b92e634f-97b3-4ed1-bc72-b8e33d45b8f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddf160889374bfee50af091d49d257eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a645ae8b/uploads/origins/b92e634f-97b3-4ed1-bc72-b8e33d45b8f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ca1eef3fea6761bbc62193064ef2e47 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！今回はオリキャラのイラストを頼みたいです。具体的にはURL参照してください。\n\n彼女は秀才、プライドが高い子。高校2年生、天野と同じクラスで、相手には自分にはない才能があるので、相手の才能をより「完成」させるためにお互いを観察し始め、やがて相手のストーカーになりますた。\n\n自由に描いていただいて構いません。 衣装のデザインを変更することも可能です。\n私の依頼を読んでいただき、ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iHyl3K-WNVFDRfsx72_GalH5LnrLs_Zw?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6b4c6065/uploads/origins/a6abbde0-8596-4077-9642-e9336176833d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36396c42d6565774686e9c7cf864bb1a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6b4c6065/uploads/origins/a6abbde0-8596-4077-9642-e9336176833d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36396c42d6565774686e9c7cf864bb1a, https://si.imgix.net/6b4c6065/uploads/origins/a6abbde0-8596-4077-9642-e9336176833d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d99024d11cdfc65a09847e6117a344c6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6b4c6065/uploads/origins/a6abbde0-8596-4077-9642-e9336176833d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=903bac4fbf76f0ea5ca2e0659e6c2432 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd love to request a drawing of my OC, Laurel. He is a priest but is cold and not a good person. Feel free to make any changes to the outfits, if you'd like. Any pose is okay. \n\nThank you for considering!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OmjveknvKorS_LwnMquQVHGAF5Fqo56R?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@negohListt/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5bcd8e6d/uploads/origins/21b282a7-5a60-4e34-910c-482f2da34668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3616ad1cb80cd61a0570d25226d3165c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5bcd8e6d/uploads/origins/21b282a7-5a60-4e34-910c-482f2da34668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3616ad1cb80cd61a0570d25226d3165c, https://si.imgix.net/5bcd8e6d/uploads/origins/21b282a7-5a60-4e34-910c-482f2da34668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c5bcb401da23c40d1aeccc5da8da131 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5bcd8e6d/uploads/origins/21b282a7-5a60-4e34-910c-482f2da34668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=186f1f22b080b3f6616fa7c7ddbfd777 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "よろしくお願いします。できれば、参考画像を参考に自由に遊んで、自分がいいと思うものを描いていただければと思います。お疲れ様でした、ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jJWDph52rBJ-nj0BRjqKJhTdKIXt5uhh", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}